message: >-
  If you use this model or data, please cite the associated article (see
  preferred-citation below) and/or this software repository using the
  metadata in this file.
type: software
title: "JQIE: Job-Quality Impact Explorer"
abstract: >-
  An agent-based simulation of frontline retail workers used to quantify the
  business value of improving job quality. This repository contains the
  NetLogo model, the simulation output data behind the associated paper's
  results, and the paper's final figures and tables.
authors:
